I used to not check for traps on chests, but I've gotten in the habit of 
checking ~5 times, and it helps a lot. Personally I think you should 
untrap the chest if you've got the HP to survive, but first make sure 
you don't have any exploding/burning things in your inventory. I've 
found that most of the time I succeed in untrapping, but certainly not 
enough to assume I will succeed.

